  triage:title "Doctor RosterNoLead finding code is never asserted by any test (re-assessment of AX6-QA1-005)" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-2 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R2-1788630712, PR #1204 report 2026-09-05T19:01Z, req-qa) at head c3268df8a3dfa5c84f4465459c5d2ba86df1c857. Re-assessment of AX6-QA1-005: the escalation-recipient store half is now fully covered, but the RosterNoLead doctor code (crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs:2211-2337 test region; production emit in doctor/ax6.rs) is never asserted by any doctor test; a repo-wide grep finds it only in production code. Fix: add a doctor test for a Herdr team with no lead that asserts the RosterNoLead code and its aggregated single-finding shape." ;
